    <string name="guide_step_1_title">1/3 · Live Film &amp; Infrared Filters</string>
    <string name="guide_step_1_body">Switch to Pro or tap “Filters” for instant Portra 400, Aerochrome IR, 720nm B&amp;W, or live Red↔Blue Swap while shooting.</string>
    <string name="guide_step_2_title">2/3 · Color Mixer &amp; Pick Color</string>
    <string name="guide_step_2_body">In Color → Color Mixer or Pick Color, shift any color up to 360° live. Panels automatically fade out while you drag sliders.</string>
    <string name="guide_step_3_title">3/3 · Edit Gallery &amp; Captured Photos</string>
    <string name="guide_step_3_body">Tap “Studio” in the top bar or tap your last photo thumbnail to edit any gallery photo with the exact same engine.</string>
